Future.

44
00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:12.970
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.652
Sreypich, what is your dream job?

46
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.636
I want to become a doctor.

47
00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:20.707
Why?

48
00:02:22.017 --> 00:02:25.247
My passion is helping people, and I am good at science.

49
00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.213
What is your goal for this year?

50
00:02:29.517 --> 00:02:32.236
My goal is to get good grades in biology.

51
00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.153
Grammar focus: I want to become a.

52
00:02:36.453 --> 00:02:40.011
I want to become a doctor. She wants to become an engineer.

53
00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:45.306
Use 'an' before a job that starts with a vowel sound: an engineer, an artist.

54
00:02:46.317 --> 00:02:48.946
Now read and listen. My Future Career.

55
00:02:49.246 --> 00:02:51.245
I have many dreams for the future.

56
00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:55.803
I want to become an engineer and build bridges in Cambodia.

57
00:02:57.117 --> 00:02:59.673
My passion is math, and I have a talent for drawing.

58
00:03:00.983 --> 00:03:04.597
To reach my goal, I need to study hard and learn new skills.

59
00:03:05.883 --> 00:03:08.394
My ambition is to make my country stronger.

60
00:03:09.683 --> 00:03:12.173
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:12.473 --> 00:03:14.484
I want to become blank artist.

62
00:03:14.784 --> 00:03:17.195
A, an. B, a. C, the.

63
00:03:21.183 --> 00:03:22.672
The answer is A: an.

64
00:03:24.183 --> 00:03:27.472
A natural ability to do something well is a blank.

65
00:03:27.772 --> 00:03:31.042
A, talent. B, career. C, future.

66
00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.759
The answer is A: talent.

67
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.377
Something you want to achieve is a blank.

68
00:03:40.677 --> 00:03:43.994
A, goal. B, passion. C, skill.

69
00:03:47.983 --> 00:03:49.611
The answer is A: goal.

70
00:03:51.117 --> 00:03:54.909
Now it's your turn to speak. What is your dream job? Why?

71
