I want to become a teacher because my passion is helping children. My goal is to study English at university.

72
00:04:06.656 --> 00:04:08.435
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:14.006
Great work today! You learned eight new words and i want to become a.

74
00:04:14.306 --> 00:04:18.189
Today's value is ambition. Dream big and work hard for your future.

75
